{'symbol': 'AIZ', 'date': '2022-10-03 08:30:00', 'title': 'CPR CELL PHONE REPAIR PARTNERS WITH MOBILESENTRIX, A LEADING WIRELESS REPAIR PARTS DISTRIBUTOR IN THE U.S.', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CPR CELL PHONE REPAIR (CPR), THE NATION'S LARGEST MOBILE REPAIR FRANCHISE ACCORDING TO FRANCHISE.COM AND THE TOP RANKED FRANCHISE FOR ELECTRONICS REPAIR IN THE 2022 ENTREPRENEUR FRANCHISE 500, ANNOUNCED THAT MOBILESENTRIX, ONE OF THE LARGEST WIRELESS REPAIR PARTS AND ACCESSORIES DISTRIBUTOR IN THE U.S., WILL BECOME CPR'S PRIMARY DISTRIBUTOR OF AFTERMARKET PARTS. “PARTNERING WITH MOBILESENTRIX OFFERS QUALITY PARTS FOR OUR CUSTOMERS AND COMPETITIVE PRICING AND SERVICING"}